{"id":152,"flavor":[{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"In battle, Chikorita waves its leaf around to keep the foe at bay. However, a sweet fragrance also wafts from the leaf, becalming the battling Pokémon and creating a cozy, friendly atmosphere all around."},{"games":["Y","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It uses the leaf on its head to determine the temperature and humidity. It loves to sunbathe."},{"games":["X","HeartGold"],"text":"A sweet aroma gently wafts from the leaf on its head. It is docile and loves to soak up sun rays."},{"games":["SoulSilver"],"text":"Its pleasantly aromatic leaf has the ability to check humidity and temperature."},{"games":["LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"A sweet aroma gently wafts from the leaf on its head. It is docile and loves to soak up the sun’s rays."},{"games":["FireRed","Silver"],"text":"Its pleasantly aromatic leaves have the ability to check the humidity and temperature."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"It waves its leaf around to keep foes at bay. However, a sweet fragrance also wafts from the leaf, creating a friendly atmosphere that becalms the battlers."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"It loves to bask in the sunlight. It uses the leaf on its head to seek out warm places."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Overgrow","hidden":false,"description":"Powers up Grass-type moves when the Pokémon's HP is low."},{"name":"Leaf Guard","hidden":true,"description":"Prevents status conditions in harsh sunlight."}],"eggGroups":["Monster","Grass"],"genderRate":1,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":"grassland","color":"Green","shape":"Quadruped","evolution":{"id":152,"name":"Chikorita","condition":null,"children":[{"id":153,"name":"Bayleef","condition":"Lv. 16","children":[{"id":154,"name":"Meganium","condition":"Lv. 32","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,33],[1,45],[6,75],[9,77],[12,235],[17,115],[20,345],[23,73],[